        "original_id": "db97aba5-3822-5b97-ab3d-633e32d02678",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christoph Martin Wieland, Carl Maria von Weber, Maxine Peake, Matt Lucas, John Hannah, Nonso Anozie\n- Works: Geschichte des Agathon, Oberon, A Midsummer Night's Dream\n- Characters: Oberon, Titania, Bottom, Theseus\n- Concepts: Bildungsroman\n- Topics: medieval and Renaissance literature, opera, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Christoph Martin Wieland is best remembered for writing the first Bildungsroman, \"Geschichte des Agathon.\"\n- Christoph Martin Wieland also wrote the epic \"Oberon.\"\n- Carl Maria von Weber's opera \"Oberon\" was based on Christoph Martin Wieland's epic of the same name.\n- In medieval and Renaissance literature, Oberon is a king of the fairies.\n- The 2016 film \"A Midsummer Night's Dream\" stars Maxine Peake as Titania, Matt Lucas as Bottom, John Hannah as Theseus, and Nonso Anozie as Oberon.",
